# MandiMitra 🌾

## Project Overview
MandiMitra helps farmers compare crop prices at different mandis and estimate their returns after transportation costs.

## Problem Statement
Farmers may not know which mandi offers the best return after travel expenses.

## Our Solution
Our application compares two mandis and recommends the option with the higher estimated net return based on user-entered prices and costs.

## Features
- Crop selection
- Quantity input
- Mandi price comparison
- Transportation cost calculation
- Estimated net return
- Simple recommendation

## Technology Stack
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- GitHub

## Calculation Formula
Net Return = (Quantity in quintals × Price per quintal) − Transport Cost

## Future Improvements
- Live mandi price integration
- AI-powered recommendations
- Support for more crops and mandis
- Farmer-friendly multilingual interface

## Limitations
The current prototype uses sample prices. It does not yet use live mandi data.

